Source: praya-gnome-shell-extension
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Maintainer: BlankOn Linux <blankon-dev@googlegroups.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://blankonlinux.id
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: praya-gnome-shell-extension
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 50~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Praya GNOME Shell Extension
 A GNOME Shell extension for BlankOn Linux that provides
 the Praya desktop experience.

Package: praya-gnome-shell-extension-generic
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 50~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Praya GNOME Shell Extension (generic build)
 A GNOME Shell extension that provides the Praya desktop experience
 for distributions other than BlankOn Linux. It ships the generic
 variant: no BlankOn branding, no BlankOn-specific defaults, and the
 start button defaults to an "Applications" icon and label.
